    this.roundMap.set('AA.Uen00140',',AA.Uen00140,EdUGames tm,20040925,10,PeLePoUSPr,LiMoEn,,PoAm LaWo CuSc Di CoSl CoWo,bushisms;presidents,,aPRA1_32 zPRA1_15,,,,,US/Presidents/Bush-GW,Unscramble the Bushisms.,,Rows=4 Cols=2 FntSize=14 FntColor=black BkGndColor=white LnCnt=2 SingleScreen=No Sort=No ,Our priorities; is our faith.;,...I don~t need to; be subliminabable..;,They have miscalculated; me as a leader.;,It~s going to require; numerous IRA agents.;,I will have a foreign;handed foreign policy.;,I am aperson who ;recognizes the fallacy of humans...;,I know the human being; and fish can coexist peacefully.;,The point is- this is a way to help inoculate; me about what has come and is coming.;,We don~t believe in planners and deciders; making the decisions on behalf of Americans.;,The best way to relieve families from time; is to let them keep some of their own money.;,If I~m the president- we~re going to have; emergency room care  we~re going to have gag orders.;,Well- I think if you say you~re going to; do something and don~t do it- that~s trustworthiness.;,We cannot let terriers* and rogue nations; hold this nation hostile or hold our allies hostile.;,This is what I~m good at. I like meeting people; my fellow citizens- I like interfacing with them.;,One of the common denominators I have found; is that expectations rise above that which is expected.;,I mean- there needs to be a wholesale effort; against racial profiling- which is illiterate children.;,We~ll let our friends be the peacekeepers; and the great country called America will be the pacemakers.;,I would have my secretary of treasury; be in touch with the financial centers- not only here but at home;,As governor of Texas- I have set high standards; for our public schools- and I have met those standards.;,I regret that a private comment I made to the; vice presidential candidate made it through the public airways.;');
